@startuml
title KTOB — Reading Experience State Machine
[*] --> WANT_TO_READ
WANT_TO_READ --> CURRENTLY_READING : start
CURRENTLY_READING --> PAUSED : pause
PAUSED --> CURRENTLY_READING : resume
CURRENTLY_READING --> FINISHED : finish
CURRENTLY_READING --> DID_NOT_FINISH : stop permanently
PAUSED --> DID_NOT_FINISH : abandon
DID_NOT_FINISH --> CURRENTLY_READING : resume later
FINISHED --> [*] : experience archived
note right of FINISHED
Reread creates another ReadingExperience,
with its own independent dates, notes and rating.
Historical records may be entered directly in
any valid status, not forced through this path.
end note
@enduml
